OL,3,AWho does Iran trade with and what could
OL,4,ATrump's 'economic D-Day' mean?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has said "the single greatest
OL,7,Ffinancial offensive ever" will help it
OL,8,Fand Israel end their ongoing war with
OL,9,FIran.
OL,11,FHowever, Iran has shrugged off
OL,12,FPresident Donald Trump and his Treasury
OL,13,FSecretary Scott Bessent's warning,
OL,14,Fsaying it is "fully prepared" for the
OL,15,Fsanctions.
OL,17,FIran is no stranger to US sanctions.
OL,18,FThe regime has been under near
OL,19,Fcontinuous American economic pressure
OL,20,Fsince the Islamic Revolution of 1979.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
